# Simple Image Uploader

A fullstack application that allows users to upload images directly from the browser.

## Demo

🔗 [Live Demo](https://image-upload-ced.vercel.app/)

## Features

- Drag & Drop to upload an image
- Local file selector
- Loading indicator during upload
- Image preview after successful upload
- Copy image URL to clipboard

## Tech Stack

| Layer | Technology |
|-------|------------|
| Frontend | React + Tailwind CSS |
| Backend | Node.js (Express.js) |
| Deployment | Vercel (frontend) + Render (backend) |

## Getting Started

### Prerequisites

- Node.js installed
- npm or yarn

### Installation

```bash
# Clone the repo
git clone https://github.com/your-username/simple-image-uploader.git
cd simple-image-uploader

# Install dependencies
npm install

# Run the project
npm run dev   
